# Title Page

**Project Title:** AI-Powered Job Recruitment System

**Developed By:** Akella Lakshmi Aiswarya and Mandapati Radhika Satya Malleswari

**Course:** Bachelor of Technology (Computer Science Engineering – Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning)

