# 5. System Modules

## 5.1 Job Opening Management

Recruiters create and manage job openings including:

* Job Title
* Department
* Location
* Salary
* Hiring Status
* Required Skills

---

## 5.2 Candidate Application Management

Candidate applications contain:

* Candidate Details
* Contact Information
* Applied Position
* Resume Information
* AI Candidate Score
* Application Status
* Approval Status

---

## 5.3 Flow Automation

Salesforce Flow Builder automates:

* Candidate submission
* Notification process
* Approval initiation
* Status updates
* Automated field updates

This reduces repetitive manual work.

---

## 5.4 Approval Process

The approval process ensures every candidate follows a structured review process before selection.

Approval stages include:

* Pending
* Approved
* Rejected

Managers receive approval requests automatically.

---

## 5.5 Reports

Recruitment reports provide insights into:

* Total Applications
* Approved Candidates
* Pending Applications
* Job-wise Applications
* Candidate Status Distribution

---

## 5.6 Dashboards

Interactive dashboards visualize recruitment performance using charts and graphs.

Dashboards display:

* Recruitment Overview
* Hiring Progress
* Candidate Pipeline
* Approval Statistics
* Application Trends

---

## 5.7 Agentforce Assistant

Agentforce enhances recruitment through AI by assisting recruiters with:

* Candidate summaries
* AI candidate scoring
* Hiring recommendations
* Recruitment insights
* Productivity improvements

---

# 6. Workflow

The recruitment workflow follows these steps:

```
Job Opening Created
        ↓
Candidate Applies
        ↓
Candidate Application Created
        ↓
AI Candidate Score Generated
        ↓
Flow Automation Triggered
        ↓
Approval Process Initiated
        ↓
Manager Review
        ↓
Approved / Rejected
        ↓
Hiring Decision
```

---

